<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>endlessly</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Chanpan</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">endlessly</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">0xsACxtkQkj3tCkmg0ZPUX</ttm:item>
      <itunes:duration>03:03.000</itunes:duration>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:11.680" end="00:17.350" ttm:agent="v1">Listen to the stillness, and remember, hold your temper</p>
      <p begin="00:17.350" end="00:23.430" ttm:agent="v1">You're laying down the groundwork underneath</p>
      <p begin="00:23.430" end="00:29.170" ttm:agent="v1">Those who came before you never faltered, yet you ponder</p>
      <p begin="00:29.170" end="00:34.770" ttm:agent="v1">'Bout futures you could never oversee</p>
      <p begin="00:34.770" end="00:40.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">They're calling, sounding the alarms (ooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:40.450" end="00:46.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Your mind is stuck in the clouds (ooh-ooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:46.960" end="00:52.660" ttm:agent="v1">Open endless skies of cotton</p>
      <p begin="00:52.660" end="00:58.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Melting slowly into sea (ooh-ooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:58.350" end="01:03.560" ttm:agent="v1">Gently sparkling underwater</p>
      <p begin="01:03.560" end="01:11.560" ttm:agent="v1">Floating downward endlessly</p>
      <p begin="01:21.620" end="01:27.490" ttm:agent="v1">You're trudging through the thick of your desires, under fire</p>
      <p begin="01:27.490" end="01:33.630" ttm:agent="v1">Freedom can't be held by bars of steel</p>
      <p begin="01:33.630" end="01:35.950" ttm:agent="v1">Plant your feet in the ground, my brother</p>
      <p begin="01:35.950" end="01:39.140" ttm:agent="v1">Take apart all that makes you suffer</p>
      <p begin="01:39.140" end="01:45.680" ttm:agent="v1">When you hold your tongue, your wounds can never heal</p>
      <p begin="01:45.680" end="01:51.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Open endless skies of cotton (run it, we run it, we run it)</p>
      <p begin="01:51.530" end="01:57.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Melting slowly into sea (ooh-ooh)</p>
      <p begin="01:57.220" end="02:03.140" ttm:agent="v1">Gently sparkling underwater</p>
      <p begin="02:03.140" end="02:07.800" ttm:agent="v1">Floating downward endlessly</p>
      <p begin="02:07.800" end="02:10.380" ttm:agent="v1">They're sounding the alarms</p>
      <p begin="02:10.380" end="02:13.070" ttm:agent="v1">Your feet pounding the ground</p>
      <p begin="02:13.070" end="02:16.020" ttm:agent="v1">Be careful what you pray for</p>
      <p begin="02:16.020" end="02:19.630" ttm:agent="v1">Your victory resounds</p>
      <p begin="02:19.630" end="02:22.430" ttm:agent="v1">No need to keep it humble, humble</p>
      <p begin="02:22.430" end="02:25.010" ttm:agent="v1">Your glory never dies</p>
      <p begin="02:25.010" end="02:28.090" ttm:agent="v1">Your memory is eternal, eternal</p>
      <p begin="02:28.090" end="02:30.910" ttm:agent="v1">You lived a worthy life</p>
      <p begin="02:30.910" end="02:35.330" ttm:agent="v1">They're sounding the alarms</p>
      <p begin="02:35.330" end="02:43.080" ttm:agent="v1">Be careful what you pray for</p>
      <p begin="02:43.080" end="02:47.080" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
